    <div class="eyebrow">Case Study · Security &amp; Social Engineering</div>
    <h1 class="cs-title display" style="margin-top:16px;">Anatomy of a phishing campaign</h1>
    <p class="cs-lede">A stage-by-stage breakdown of how a single, unremarkable-looking email became one of the most consequential breaches in cybersecurity history — analyzed here as an educational case study in how spear phishing actually works.</p>
    <div class="cs-meta">
      <div><h4>Role</h4><p>Security Researcher &amp; Author</p></div>
      <div><h4>Case</h4><p>RSA SecurID breach, 2011</p></div>
      <div><h4>Method</h4><p>Public-record incident analysis</p></div>
      <div><h4>Focus</h4><p>Spear phishing · Social engineering</p></div>
    </div>
